+    WrongAtomicGuard, UnguardedCandidate, WrongStep, WrongLocalIndex, Multiwave,
+    OuterReentry, InnerAppendCycle, EarlyCounterRead, WrongConsumerBound, ExtraWriter, CounterAlias,
+    PayloadWrap, CounterOob
